WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.852
Previously, selecting CMS inserted a fixed
allowance automatically.

00:00:03.852 --> 00:00:06.479
Matt did not enter that amount.

00:00:06.479 --> 00:00:10.857
The fifteen thousand dollar default was not
calculating the control

00:00:10.857 --> 00:00:13.046
system from his display pixels.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:19.246
Here is the corrected workflow, using a
separate two-display test above

00:00:19.246 --> 00:00:23.878
thirteen million pixels. These are test
inputs, not Matt's confirmed

00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:28.047
original measurements. In the estimate,
select Yes for CMS.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.633
The control-system package calculates
automatically, right here in

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:37.422
the estimate. Open the CMS tab to review the
equipment, quantities,

00:00:37.422 --> 00:00:41.776
costs and selling prices. The calculation
uses Jackson's existing selection

00:00:41.776 --> 00:00:43.517
rules and catalog prices.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.662
Open CMS requirements to check the scope.

00:00:47.662 --> 00:00:51.534
Sports venue, professional stadium, software
license and live video

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:55.406
settings affect the package. Changing a
requirement recalculates the

00:00:55.406 --> 00:00:59.279
price automatically. Choose only what the
actual job needs.

00:01:00.383 --> 00:01:04.398
The calculated CMS price carries into the
estimate summaries and the

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:08.048
Excel download. Select Export to keep the
full itemized workbook.

00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:13.157
There is no need to copy a price from the
separate Control System tool.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:18.572
This fixes automatic CMS pricing in the
estimator, not the separate

00:01:18.572 --> 00:01:21.691
processing package. Processing pricing still
needs verification before

00:01:21.691 --> 00:01:24.420
a complete quote goes to a client.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:29.489
The old fifteen thousand dollar default is
no longer used for the CMS

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:29.878
calculation.
